  "focusKeyword": "7 days in Bali with kids",
  "intro": "Bali with young kids is easy to get wrong by trying to do too much. This relaxed 7-day itinerary keeps the pace gentle across two or three calm bases, Sanur, Ubud and Nusa Dua, with the wildlife, waterpark and pool time children actually remember, and the short transfers that keep everyone sane.",
